{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國股市個別發展，科技股有沽壓，納斯達克指數跌勢未止。道瓊斯工業平均指數早段則反彈約300點。</p><p></p><p>科技股普遍受壓，戴爾電腦再急挫約百分之9，英特爾跌逾半成。</p><p></p><p>晶片股輝達、美光科技及閃迪，早段跌百分之3至8。台積電上季純利再破頂，但在美國股價不升反跌約百分之4。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T15:40:50.148653+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T14:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T16:17:46.013829+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T15:38:16.887947+00:00","content_hash":"32d2e9825df842c70fcb0bcbb4a246e5ad18b88ff8c24eb0264d005e5f0940d9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}